{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>ושחטה</b> — And to slaughter, by way of." "<b>סטים</b> — They are the worshippers of Baal." "<b>העמיקו</b> — The pit, those mentioned, perhaps passersby will not see it, and I will bind them all for this evil they did, for it is not hidden from me; <b>for they have deepened</b>, therefore."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:14.011526181Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}